{"id":"d0ca45930c78f83d","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-lem-continuum-cc.md","title":"Continuum Preservation","display":"lem-continuum-cc — Continuum Preservation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-continuum-cc","aliases":["58-lem-continuum-cc"],"display":"lem-continuum-cc — Continuum Preservation","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-continuum-cc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-continuum-cc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-continuum-cc — Continuum Preservation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"547a2141e41387ca\" href=\"?note=547a2141e41387ca\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md\">../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\">\\((P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\)</span> (forcing poset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c\">\\(\\mathfrak c\\)</span> (continuum, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ccc}\">\\(\\mathrm{ccc}\\)</span> (countable-chain-condition predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"547a2141e41387ca\" href=\"?note=547a2141e41387ca\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md\">../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span> (forcing-poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},P}\">\\(\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},P}\\)</span> (the ambient forcing relation for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}continuum-cc} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{ccc}(\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle)\\land|P|\\leq\\mathfrak c\\to \\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},P}|\\mathcal{P}(\\omega)|=\\check{\\mathfrak c}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}continuum-cc} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{ccc}(\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle)\\land|P|\\leq\\mathfrak c\\to \\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},P}|\\mathcal{P}(\\omega)|=\\check{\\mathfrak c}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A c.c.c. forcing of size at most the ground-model continuum has at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c^{\\aleph_0}=\\mathfrak c\">\\(\\mathfrak c^{\\aleph_0}=\\mathfrak c\\)</span> nice names for reals and preserves all ground-model reals.</li>\n<li>Arbitrary c.c.c. forcing can increase the continuum, so the size hypothesis is essential.</li>\n<li>The forcing conclusion is metatheoretic because this atom does not define an object-language forcing predicate relative to a set ground model.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md","status":"resolved","id":"547a2141e41387ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak c$ (continuum, see [[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md","status":"resolved","id":"547a2141e41387ca","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ccc}$ (countable-chain-condition predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S$ (forcing-poset predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(P,\\leq_P,1_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ccc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},P}","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}continuum-cc} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{ccc}(\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle)\\land|P|\\leq\\mathfrak c\\to \\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},P}|\\mathcal{P}(\\omega)|=\\check{\\mathfrak c}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak c^{\\aleph_0}=\\mathfrak c","display":false}],"bytes":1479,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3886","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-lem-continuum-cc.md|58-lem-continuum-cc]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["99c5552e170feee3","547a2141e41387ca","b5833df5ef175153"]}